{"id":"6afd5572-9ea0-83ee-81b7-0d775b578b48","sections":[{"bodySize":703,"controls":{"checkbox":0,"fields":0,"radio":20,"reveal":0,"submit":1,"textarea":0},"count":5,"heading":"十一、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目設計為理解與應用練習，先不提供完整解答。你可以作答後再逐題核對。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">依現行 108 課綱的正式範圍，<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">沸點上升與凝固點下降著重粒子數和變化量的比例關係，不要求數值計算</strong></span>；滲透壓計算以強電解質為主要例子，也不要求部分解離計算。因此，下列涉及沸點、凝固點數值的題目屬於講義常見的加深練習，而不是課綱必備計算要求。<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span class=\"Trigger-y4ejT1\" data-d-component=\"popover-trigger\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-inline-text=\"\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-inline=\"\"><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Pill-vMH1qo\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-hoverable=\"\" style=\"background: var(--gray-400);\"><span class=\"Favicon-gpdrW0\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4 FaviconBox-doeXm2\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"favicon\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-width=\"\" data-d-has-height=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0; height: 12px; width: 12px;\"><img class=\"Image-LDLXtM Image-S6ohsd\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://www.ceec.edu.tw&amp;sz=32\" data-loaded=\"\"></div></span><span class=\"Label-f1ZlTd\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"3xs\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-truncate=\"true\" data-d-clamp-lines=\"true\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary); -webkit-line-clamp: 1;\">大考中心</span></span><span class=\"Count-sWqf87\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"3xs\" data-d-inline=\"\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-tertiary);\">+1</span></span></div></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 4);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">綜合練習｜5 題</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">0/5 已作答</p></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">1. 將相同莫耳數的葡萄糖與 NaCl 分別溶於相同質量的水中。假設完全解離且近似理想，何者的蒸氣壓較低？</p><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d